DELETE /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/caches/{cache_id}
Deletes a GitHub Actions cache for a repository, using a cache ID. OAuth tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the `repo` scope to use this endpoint.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; cache_id (path) — The unique identifier of the GitHub Actions cache.
